# Build output. The desktop shell compiles into its own ignored lib/, while
# every `dsh-plugin-*` plugin ships a committed lib/ on purpose: the seeded
# profile links those packages from disk, so a checkout without lib/ cannot
# boot. Never widen this to `dsh-plugin-*/lib/` or a bare `lib/`.
dsh-plugin-desktop/dist/
dsh-plugin-desktop/lib/

# Temporary logs and local gate output.
*.log
.tmp-*

